1 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
2 REM KEYTEST - WHAT DOES INKEY$ RETURN ON THIS MACHINE
3 REM PRESS KEYS, THE CODE OF EACH ONE IS PRINTED. PRESS Q TO STOP.
4 REM ARROWS SEND TWO BYTES: 27 AND THEN 65 66 67 68.
5 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
10 CLS
20 PRINT "PRESS KEYS, Q TO STOP"
30 KB$=INKEY$
40 IF KB$="" THEN GOTO 30
50 KC%=ASC(KB$)
60 PRINT KC%;
70 IF KC%=81 THEN GOTO 90
80 GOTO 30
90 PRINT
100 PRINT "DONE"
110 END
